550
00:36:37.486 --> 00:36:38.905
saya akan.

551
00:36:38.988 --> 00:36:40.156
Oh, betul.

552
00:36:40.239 --> 00:36:41.908
Lee Hwa-jin kembali.

553
00:36:42.867 --> 00:36:46.829
Oh, saya telah berniat untuk bertanya
tentang gejala dia.

554
00:36:46.913 --> 00:36:50.041
Dia berkata dia tiba-tiba pengsan kadang-kadang.

555
00:36:50.875 --> 00:36:53.586
